QuestGuidance.Register("en",32,{
[993]="70047F48\n1\tComplete 'Another Lovely Year' (total: 3)\tEvery day there is something to do during the Anniversary Festival. Come and join everyone and participate in many Anniversary Festival activities for three days!\n2\tTalk to Waldo Rumble\tWaldo Rumble would like to thank you for your continued participation in the Anniversary Festival.\n",
[994]="7000D75C\n1\tTalk to Barliman Butterbur\tBarliman Butterbur is at The Prancing Pony Inn in Bree. Still worried about making a first impression, Avery Crabapple has asked you to deliver the bouquet to the woman's door. He had discreetly asked a few people where she lived to no avail, but he would rather you ask Barliman Butterbur, the proprietor of The Prancing Pony in Bree for the address.\n2\tUse Flower Vase\030Collect Crabapple's Bouquet\tThe lady's house is the first or second door up the Scholar's Stair and over the first bridge. Barliman Butterbur told you to place the bouquet in the vase next to the door the lady's house.\n3\tTalk to Avery Crabapple\tAvery Crabapple is in the Market Square in Bree. You should return to Avery Crabapple at once.\n",
[995]="70015E00\n1\tThe half-orc tents are at Târ Stazg, north-east of Echad Dúnann, along the mountains before the Redhorn Gate. In order to drive the disorganized half-orcs from Eregion, Palanaer has tasked you with destroying their tents.\t\n2\tTalk to Palanaer\tPalanaer is in Echad Dúnann, south-west of Târ Stazg. You should return to Palanaer and report your success.\n",
[996]="7002710C\n1\tDefeat Abomination trolls (total: 5)\tThe Abomination trolls can be found at Lhan Colvarn, north of the Boar-clan encampment. Blaire has asked you to thin the ranks of the Abominations by defeating some of the trolls.\n2\tTalk to Blaire at the Boar-clan encampment\tBlaire is at the Boar-clan encampment, south of Lhan Colvarn. You should return to Blaire with news of your success.\n",
[997]="7002EF4E\n1\tFind an Orc wielding a stolen sword and take it from him\tThe Orc with the unusually high-quality sword fled after the raid to the north-east and is probably within the camp the Mordor Orcs have established between Mansig's encampment and the Wold. Wilferth saw an Orc wielding a sword well above its station and wants you to reclaim it.\n2\tBring the stolen sword to Wilferth\tWilferth is at the Rohirrim-camp in the East Wall. You have recovered the stolen sword and should return with it to Wilferth so he can see it.\n",
[998]="70043096\n1\tTalk to Daelarth\030Talk to Laerven\030Talk to Thamdir\tAngbor's men can be found in the eastern half of Pelargir. Angbor has asked you to question his men about strange things they claim to have seen in the hours preceding the battle in Pelargir.\n2\tTalk to Angbor in Pelargir\tAngbor can be found inside the eastern gate in Pelargir. You have questioned his men and should now report what you have learned to Angbor.\n",
[999]="7004D4AD\n1\tTalk to JWBarry\tBy completing this quest, you will automatically complete the Abyss of Mordath discovery, tier 1, and tier 2 raid deeds.\n",
[1000]="70064247\n1\tCollect Ukhrash Frame\t\n",
[1001]="70022B44\n1\tDefeat accursed fell spirits (total: 12)\tAccursed fell spirits can be found within the Flooded Wing of the Great Barrow.\n",
[1002]="70047BE3\n1\tThe accursed warrior can be found wandering Ondoher's Folly in north-western Dagorlad.\t\n2\tAttempt to talk to the accursed warrior at Ondoher's Folly\tThe accursed warrior can be found wandering Ondoher's Folly in north-western Dagorlad. You have encountered the shade of an accursed warrior wandering the hill of Ondoher's Folly. You should attempt to speak to him.\n",
[1003]="7004CF88\n1\tTalk to Oroniel\tYou should stand by Oroniel's side and face the dweller of Caras Tilion.\n2\tTalk to Radagast\tRadagast can be found at the tree nursery just outside of Felegoth. You should tell Radagast about what you have encountered at Caras Tilion.\n",
[1004]="7006C961\n1\tYour continued assistance with the goals and objective of the Kintai Elves earns you merit among them. They wish to honour your efforts with a gift at Shonith.\t\n2\tVisit Thridarlan at Shonith to receive a gift\tYour continued assistance with the goals and objective of the Kintai Elves earns you merit among them. They wish to honour your efforts with a gift at Shonith.\n",
[1005]="7006C955\n1\tReach Acquaintance tier with the Ikorbâni\tYou have honoured your word to assist the Ikorbâni in their efforts to restore their lands. You should return to Kildûg at Iridír to receive a reward for your continued assistance.\n2\tVisit Kildûg at Iridír to claim a gift\tYou have honoured your word to assist the Ikorbâni in their efforts to restore their lands. You should return to Kildûg at Iridír to receive a reward for your continued assistance.\n",
[1006]="7006C96C\n1\tReach Acquaintance tier with the Phetêkari\tVisit the Tale-warden Assistant, Mashêm at Telperiën's Gate, or any of the other Phetekâri quartermasters at Iridír, Jirush, or Urmâkh to claim a gift from the Tale-wardens of Umbar.\n2\tVisit Mashêm at Telperiën's Gate to claim your gift\030Visit a Tale-warden's assistant at Iridír, Jirush, or Urmâkh\tVisit the Tale-warden Assistant, Mashêm at Telperiën's Gate, or any of the other Phetekâri quartermasters at Iridír, Jirush, or Urmâkh to claim a gift from the Tale-wardens of Umbar.\n",
[1007]="70071E96\n1\tReach Acquaintance standing with the Temámir of Jiret-menêsh\tYou stand by your agreement with the Temámir of Jiret-menêsh and assist in the recovery of the broken land. You should return to Quartermaster Semanísi to see what acclaim your deeds have wrought.\n2\tSpeak with Semanísi at Jiret-menêsh\tYou stand by your agreement with the Temámir of Jiret-menêsh and assist in the recovery of the broken land. You should return to Quartermaster Semanísi to see what acclaim your deeds have wrought.\n",
[1008]="70071E93\n1\tReach Acquaintance standing with The City of Zajâna\tYou remain true to your word, aiding the City of Zajâna earnestly. You should return to the city to speak with the quartermaster to be recognized for your efforts.\n2\tSpeak with Alahamâr at Zajâna\tYou remain true to your word, aiding the City of Zajâna earnestly. You should return to the city to speak with the quartermaster to be recognized for your efforts.\n",
[1009]="7004E73F\n1\tJoin Hórin in 'Glimmerdeep'. You will find the instance on the Specific tab of the Instance Finder panel, under the Grey Mountains section.\t\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tYou should talk to Hórin at Skarháld.\n",
[1010]="7006C6FB\n1\tComplete Instance: Across the Ikorbân\tRaphûz asked you to join him for a smoke and conversation in the Wrackwade camp.\n2\tTalk to Raphûz\tAfter a good conversation and a full night, Raphûz moved on to Khûd Zagin. You should seek him at Jirush.\n",
[1011]="70007763\n1\tSearch for Amlach\tThere is a place immediately upon entering that some mistake for the Dead Man's Perch. Addie Wheatley said that her son Amlach was going to set up camp at the Dead Man's Perch, but was not there when she and her guides arrived. She fears that Amlach became lost in the southern Barrow-downs while searching for his brother, Malin.\n2\tBring the journal to Addie Wheatley\tAddie Wheatley awaits your return among the relative safety offered by the guides at the Dead Man's Perch. You have found Addie Wheatley's son, Amlach, dead within the grave-stones in the southern Barrow-downs. In his hand, you found that he was grasping a tattered journal. You should bring the journal back to Addie, as she will want to know the fate of her sons.\n",
[1012]="7004D40C\n1\tTalk to discontented Dale-folk (total: 8)\tYou should publically deter discontented Dale folk who are speaking against the refugees.\n2\tReturn to Gaumar\tYou should return to Gaumar, who stands within the Great-keep in Dale.\n",
[1013]="70000152\n1\tSpeak to Isembard Took\tPervinca thought her cousins Isembard and Imbert Took could be found near the Great Willow east of the Great Smials in Tuckborough. Pervinca asked you to find her cousins Isembard and Imbert, who went to retrieve Adelard's chapter of the Yearbook, and see what is taking him so long.\n2\tBring Adelard's chapter to Pervinca Took\tBring Adelard's chapter back to Pervinca Took in the Great Smials. Having survived Isembard's grand idea for getting the satchel with Adelard's chapter down from the tree, you finally have the chapter in hand to bring back to Pervinca.\n",
[1014]="7005D358\n1\tTalk to Kyrstig\tFind and speak to Kytstig at the entrance of The Houses of Rest.\n2\tPick up the summoning horn\t\n3\tDefeat the risen dwarf-lords\t\n4\tDefeat Loknashra\t\n5\tDefeat the wight of Vethúg Wintermind\t\n",
[1015]="7005D359\n1\tDefeat the risen dwarf-lords\t\n2\tDefeat Loknashra\t\n3\tDefeat the Wight of Vethúg Wintermind\t\n",
[1016]="7005D35A\n1\tDefeat the risen dwarf-lords\t\n2\tDefeat Loknashra\t\n3\tDefeat the Wight of Vethúg Wintermind\t\n",
[1017]="7005D35B\n1\tDefeat the risen dwarf-lords\t\n2\tDefeat Loknashra\t\n3\tDefeat the Wight of Vethúg Wintermind\t\n",
[1018]="7006042D\n1\tTalk to Drachyn\tBy completing this quest, you will automatically complete the Adkhât-zahhar, the Houses of Rest, tiers 1 and 2 instance deeds.\n",
[1019]="7006042E\n1\tTalk to Drachyn\tBy completing this quest, you will automatically complete the Adkhât-zahhar, the Houses of Rest, tier 3 instance deed.\n",
[1020]="700683D3\n1\tCollect sea-hawk feathers from nests or birds ([see journal]/14)\tLuthana's patrons in Umbar Baharbêl use sea-hawk feathers when creating some jewellery. She asked that you do your best to collect moulted feathered from their nests and from live creatures if you must.\n2\tYou collected enough feathers for Luthana. Return to the hunter's expedition in the south of the Cape of Umbar and deliver the feathers to her.\t\n",
[1021]="70000027\n1\tBring the satchel to Bill Ferny by night\030Ring the bell to summon Ferny or his assistant\tBill Ferny or his agent will be at the Old Sweetgrass Farm, north-east of Adso Haybank's camp. In order to reduce his debt, Adso Haybank has asked you to take a satchel to a man named Bill Ferny. He warns you that you will only find Ferny at the arranged meeting place after nightfall. You must ring the bell to let Ferny or his agent know you have arrived.\n2\tTalk to Adso Haybank at Adso's Camp\tAdso Haybank's camp lies south-west of the Old Sweetgrass Farm. Adso Haybank sent you to deliver a payment to the brutish Bill Ferny and now awaits your return.\n",
[1022]="7004A3A1\n1\tGather more signal flags in Udûn.\t\n2\tDeliver the flags to Barathron\tYou should return to Barathron in the Udûn Foothold and show him the flags you have found.\n",
[1023]="7006596D\n1\tHunt wild boars (total: 5)\tThe trencher-woman needs you to hunt wild boars around Lower Lebennin. Defeat wild boars around Lower Lebennin.\n2\tTalk to Valdamarca Haith\tYou have hunted enough boars and should return to Valdarmaica, the trencher-woman. Deliver boar meat to the trencher-woman.\n",
[1024]="70054675\n1\tDefeat stained merrevail (total: 15)\tStained merrevail have taken over the third tier in Minas Morgul, the Circle of Madness. You should defeat stained merrevail.\n2\tTalk to Faeron\tFaeron is stationed inside Barad Elenath, the Star-gazers' Spire. You should talk to Faeron.\n",
})
